@*
    About Us Foundation phase (2026-08-01) — docs/03_PageBlueprints.md
    "Page — About Us". Title/description/canonical/OG/AboutPage schema come
    from ViewData["Seo"] + ViewData["SeoPageType"], set in
    AboutController.Index via ISeoService — see _Layout.cshtml's <head> and
    SeoStructuredDataViewComponent.

    Folkart-reference revision (2026-08-13, project owner-approved) — page
    flow rebuilt to follow the supplied Folkart "Hakkımızda" screenshot's
    layout: Breadcrumb → plain page heading (no Hero Banner) → existing
    About text → Mission & Vision panel → remaining About text → Footer.
    HeroBannerStandard and OurJourneyViewComponent are intentionally not
    invoked here — the project owner asked for no hero area at all on this
    page, and for Our Journey (milestones timeline) to be dropped from it.
    Neither component nor its assets were modified or deleted; both are
    simply unused by this page now. See CompanyIntroductionViewComponent
    (now split into "intro"/"closing" parts) and MissionVisionViewComponent
    (now a darkened image panel, not an Information Card grid) for the
    sections themselves.
*@

@{
    var breadcrumbTrail = new List<AncinInsaat.ViewComponents.BreadcrumbItem>
    {
        new() { Label = "Hakkımızda" }
    };
}
@await Component.InvokeAsync("Breadcrumb", new { trail = breadcrumbTrail, homeLabel = "Anasayfa" })

<section class="section about-heading-section">
    <div class="container">
        <h1 id="about-heading" class="about-heading">Hakkımızda</h1>
    </div>
</section>

@await Component.InvokeAsync("CompanyIntroduction", new { part = "intro" })

@await Component.InvokeAsync("MissionVision")

@await Component.InvokeAsync("CompanyIntroduction", new { part = "closing" })
